"person_id":"q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAE","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"《陳書》稱王通之弟，並明言隨兄質。"},{"id":"c-chenshu-021-chen21:p002:m0011","start":11,"end":12,"surface":"質","kind":"person","person_id":"q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAD","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"《陳書》稱王通之弟；同父為家系判讀。"}],"chapter_id":"c-chenshu-021-chen21","book_id":"b-chenshu-021","work_id":"w-chenshu","source_id":"s-chenshu-021-chen21-ws1511909"},{"id":"c-chenshu-021-chen21:p003","text":"高宗以固本無兵權，且居處清潔，止免所居官，禁錮。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"id":"c-chenshu-021-chen21:p003:m0003","start":3,"end":4,"surface":"固","kind":"person","person_id":"q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAE","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"《陳書》稱王通之弟，並明言隨兄質。"}],"chapter_id":"c-chenshu-021-chen21","book_id":"b-chenshu-021","work_id":"w-chenshu","source_id":"s-chenshu-021-chen21-ws1511909"},{"id":"c-chenshu-021-chen21:p004","text":"太建二年，隨例為招遠將軍、宣惠豫章王諮議參軍。遷太中大夫、太常卿、南徐州大中正。七年，卒官，時年六十三。贈金紫光祿大夫。喪事所須，隨由資給。至德二年改葬，謚曰恭子。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[],"chapter_id":"c-chenshu-021-chen21","book_id":"b-chenshu-021","work_id":"w-chenshu","source_id":"s-chenshu-021-chen21-ws1511909"},{"id":"c-chenshu-021-chen21:p005","text":"固清虛寡慾，居喪以孝聞。又崇信佛法，及丁所生母憂，遂終身蔬食，夜則坐禪，晝誦佛經，兼習成實論義，而於玄言非所長。嘗聘於西魏，因宴饗之際，請停殺一羊，羊於固前跪拜。又宴於昆明池，魏人以南人嗜魚，大設罟網，固以佛法呪之，遂一鱗不獲。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"id":"c-chenshu-021-chen21:p005:m0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"固","kind":"person","person_id":"q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAE","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"《陳書》稱王通之弟，並明言隨兄質。"},{"id":"c-chenshu-021-chen21:p005:m0076","start":76,"end":77,"surface":"固","kind":"person","person_id":"q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAE","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"《陳書》稱王通之弟，並明言隨兄質。"},{"id":"c-chenshu-021-chen21:p005:m0101","start":101,"end":102,"surface":"固","kind":"person","person_id":"q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAE","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"《陳書》稱王通之弟，並明言隨兄質。"}],"chapter_id":"c-chenshu-021-chen21","book_id":"b-chenshu-021","work_id":"w-chenshu","source_id":"s-chenshu-021-chen21-ws1511909"},{"id":"c-chenshu-021-chen21:p006","text":"子寬，官至司徒左長史、侍中。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"id":"c-chenshu-021-chen21:p006:m0001","start":1,"end":2,"surface":"寬","kind":"person","person_id":"q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAEA","identification_status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"《陳書》王固傳末記子寬。"}],"chapter_id":"c-chenshu-021-chen21","book_id":"b-chenshu-021","work_id":"w-chenshu","source_id":"s-chenshu-021-chen21-ws1511909"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-chenshu-021-chen21","work_id":"w-chenshu","book_id":"b-chenshu-021","source_id":"s-chenshu-021-chen21-ws1511909","source":{"title":"陳書卷21·王固傳","provider":"Wikisource","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=陳書/卷21&oldid=1511909","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=陳書/卷21&oldid=1511909","revision_id":1511909,"accessed_on":"2026-11-19","edition":"維基文庫固定數位見證，所據刻本待核，未核武英殿本。","extent":"王固傳的指定句段，用於親屬、身份、任官及紀年查核。","text_scope":"partial_chapter","image_verified":false,"review_status":"text_checked","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","rights":"古代正文及維基文庫數位轉錄，保留見證歸屬。","section_locator":"王固傳"}}],"time_policy":{"unknown_is_not_unbounded":true,"attestation_is_not_tenure":true,"date_expressions_are_not_normalized":false,"date_normalization_coverage":"partial","normalized_year_numbering":"astronomical","civil_year_label_field":"chinese_civil_year","civil_year_label_coverage":"partial","regnal_year_crosses_ce_year_is_gregorian_projection":true},"assembled_identity":{"person_id":"q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAE","representative_source_person_id":"q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAE","source_person_ids":["q7m_r8k_2vn_ABAE"],"identity_equivalence_decision_ids":[],"parent_pe